<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Telefonica upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Telefonica upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns said analyst Rizwan Ali had raised his rating for Telefonica de Argentina SA to attractive from neutral.</p>
<p>-- In a Feb 3 report, Ali wrote that a tariff rebalancing last week had gone better than expected.</p>
<p>-- He maintained his attractive rating for Telecom Argentina.</p>
<p>-- Telefonica's American Depositary Receipts (ADRs) were off 1/2 to 30-3/8 in New York. Telecom's ADRs were off one to 47.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
